## Never discard uncommitted work
- NEVER run or ask user to paste `git reset --hard`, `git checkout -- <file>`, `git restore`, `git clean`,
  or `git stash drop` while the working tree has ANY uncommitted changes (`git status` first,
  every time). If cleanup needs a destructive command, `git stash push -u -m "backup"` FIRST,
  state what would be destroyed, and wait for user's explicit ok. OR, ask user is the uncommitted changes should be kept FIRST and then proceed once receiving his response.

